{
  "_readme": "id = NN-slug (file name images/<id>.png). viewport desktop|mobile. auth none|b2c|b2b|reseller|admin. batch now = areas B4 does not touch, b4 = capture again in the final run after batch B4 (needs: fixture = temporary company data from scripts/data/b3-fixture.php create; order = one test order placed on the store; no-company = capture BEFORE the fixture is created, the b2c test user must not belong to a company; clean-data = capture when the lists hold only the intended sample rows). designer:true waits for the designer to load. See capture/README.md for actions and highlight.",
